# Audit scratch space. artifacts/marketing-requests-audit alone is 235 files / 4.4 MB, nearly all of
# it COPIES of this repo's own app/, src/ and tests/ trees — the same anti-pattern as the audit
# source zips below. Worse than untidy: tsc walked those copies and failed on them (TS7006 in
# artifacts/.../tests/sales-marketing-line-scope.test.ts), which blocked the pre-push hook for
# everyone until `artifacts` was added to tsconfig's exclude alongside this rule.
artifacts/

# Source-dump archives produced by the audit workflow. Two of them (DIRECT_ORDERS_DELTA_SOURCE.zip,
# OUTSTATION_EXPENSES_SOURCE.zip) were committed by accident on 2026-08-12 — 1.03 MB of BINARY
# holding nothing but copies of this repo's own app/, src/ and docs/ trees, which git already
# stores far better as text. Never reached main; this rule keeps it that way.
# A zip that genuinely belongs in the repo can still be added with `git add -f`.
*.zip

